      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Project Structure**\n\nI'm structuring the Python project for OCR and layout extraction. I'm focusing on creating those nine new Python files and keeping extract_text.py untouched. Each \"scored\" file will employ a concrete external provider to handle its scoring function. I will need to ensure those are well-defined.\n\n\n**Mapping External Providers**\n\nI'm now mapping external providers to the new files. I'm leveraging Google Cloud services, specifically Document AI for OCR, layout, tables, and key-value extraction, Cloud Translation API for translation, and Vertex AI with `gemini-pro` for content moderation and embedding. I will design the interfaces between my new files, and I'll create helper files to support these integrations.\n\n\n**Reviewing Core Module**\n\nI've begun reviewing `extract_text.py` to grasp its structure and provider usage. This informs the design of the \"SAME-SCENARIO\" files. I'm choosing Google Cloud Document AI for `extract_layout.py`, `extract_tables.py`, and `extract_key_values.py`, aiming for consistency.\nI'll use Google Cloud Translation API for translation and Vertex AI with `gemini-pro` for content moderation and embeddings in other files, all interfaces are compatible.\nI'll create helper files for integration.\n\n\n",
